sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client (Claude Code / Codex)
  participant D as AICL DNS :53
  participant G as AICL gateway :443
  participant E as decide() + budget ledger
  participant P as Real provider
  C->>D: A api.anthropic.com ?
  D-->>C: A = gateway IP, no AAAA, query audited
  C->>G: TLS ClientHello, SNI api.anthropic.com
  G-->>C: leaf cert (SAN = all intercepted hosts) signed by the AICL CA
  C->>G: POST /v1/messages (stream, client's own key)
  Note over C,E: router by Host, adapter parses the parts<br/>identity from clients: IP, key hash, user agent
  G->>E: decide(Event stage=prompt)
  E-->>G: Decision ALLOW / REDACT / BLOCK
  alt BLOCK on the request
    G-->>C: native 400 invalid_request_error "[AICL] ..." (402 when the budget is spent)
  else ALLOW or REDACT
    Note over C,E: budget reserve, REDACT spans rewritten in place
    G->>P: request, client's own Authorization / x-api-key unchanged
    P-->>G: SSE answer (buffered before the first byte is released)
    G->>E: decide(Event stage=response) on the text
    G->>E: decide(Event stage=tool_args) on tool_use blocks
    E-->>G: Decision
    Note over C,E: budget settled from usage, audit written
    alt answer or tool call blocked
      G-->>C: HTTP 200 assistant text "[AICL] ... blocked", tool call dropped
    else clean or redacted
      G-->>C: native answer, byte-identical when nothing changed
    end
  end
